  "description": "A place where money is needed to sharpen a sword, to feed and clothe your disciples—no, to simply breathe. \n\nThe Murim.    \n\nDo you need money? Has your credit rating dropped? Then come to the Continental Battlefield. Unsecured same-day loan approval. \n\nYou don't have the money to pay? Ah. Don't worry. We accept your body. Relax! You'll get injured! Thank you, sir!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=851610), [Naver Series](https://m.series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14270649)",
